      "Call the Spirits": {"route":"goWide","pace":"ENCHANTMENT TOKENS","complexity":"Intermediate","theme":"Daxos turns each enchantment spell into lasting experience and an army of growing Spirits.","plan":"Develop mana and protective enchantments, build experience, then create Spirits while leaving mana for interaction.","mulligan":"Keep three lands, a mana rock and an inexpensive enchantment.","tip":"Experience counters stay with you when Daxos leaves. Spirit size follows their controller’s experience total.","keys":["Mesa Enchantress","Grasp of Fate","Doomwake Giant"]},
      "Seize Control": {"route":"spells","pace":"SPELLS AND EXPERIENCE","complexity":"Advanced","theme":"Mizzix makes large instants and sorceries affordable as your experience grows.","plan":"Cast increasingly large spells, protect Mizzix and turn card draw into a decisive chain of damage and copies.","mulligan":"Keep three lands, early interaction and a draw spell or mana rock.","tip":"Experience reduces generic mana only. Choose X before paying; the spell’s mana value includes X on the Stack.","keys":["Mizzix's Mastery","Melek, Izzet Paragon","Blue Sun's Zenith"]},
      "Plunder the Graves": {"route":"graveyard","pace":"CREATURE RECURSION","complexity":"Intermediate","theme":"Meren builds experience from fallen creatures and brings them back at your end step.","plan":"Trade creatures for value, reuse their entry abilities and let experience turn end-step returns into battlefield advantage.","mulligan":"Keep three lands, an early creature and ramp or a sacrifice outlet.","tip":"Meren returns a creature directly only when its mana value is no greater than your experience. Otherwise it returns to hand.","keys":["Sakura-Tribe Elder","Skullwinder","Victimize"]},
      "Wade into Battle": {"route":"bigCreatures","pace":"GIANTS AND EQUIPMENT","complexity":"Intermediate","theme":"Kalemne gains experience from expensive creatures and becomes a vigilant double-strike threat.","plan":"Ramp into large creatures, keep blockers while Kalemne attacks and use Equipment or removal to clear a finishing swing.","mulligan":"Keep three lands, a mana rock and a creature you can cast before the late game.","tip":"A creature spell with mana value five or more earns experience even if that spell is countered.","keys":["Blade of Selves","Urza's Incubator","Thundercloud Shaman"]},
