    "Sworn to Darkness": {"route":"graveyard","pace":"BLACK ATTRITION","complexity":"Intermediate","theme":"Ob Nixilis builds a Demon army while black mana engines, sacrifice and life drain wear down the table.","plan":"Develop Swamps and mana multipliers, then stabilize with removal and large Demons. Sacrifice creatures for value, reanimate threats, and use life drain to close the game.","mulligan":"Keep three Swamps, a mana rock or draw spell, and a useful removal spell.","tip":"Abyssal Persecutor stops your opponents from losing while you control it. Keep a sacrifice outlet or removal spell ready before the finishing blow.","keys":["Crypt Ghast","Ghoulcaller Gisa","Gray Merchant of Asphodel"]},
    "Built from Scratch": {"route":"artifacts","pace":"ARTIFACT REANIMATION","complexity":"Advanced","theme":"Daretti turns discarded machines into battlefield threats and rebuilds after every exchange.","plan":"Use inexpensive artifacts for mana and cards, discard expensive machines, and return them with Daretti or Goblin Welder. Save Scrap Mastery to rebuild a decisive artifact board.","mulligan":"Keep three lands, an early artifact mana source, and an artifact to discard or sacrifice.","tip":"Daretti’s minus ability targets an artifact card in your graveyard before you sacrifice anything. The sacrificed artifact cannot be that ability’s return target.","keys":["Goblin Welder","Wurmcoil Engine","Scrap Mastery"]},
