    "Prismari Performance": {"route":"spells","pace":"BIG SPELLS","complexity":"Advanced","theme":"Zaffai rewards large instants, sorceries, and copies with Elementals and bursts of damage.","plan":"Build mana and establish spell payoffs before casting large instants and sorceries. Chain draw and copy effects to create Constructs and Elementals while keeping interaction available.","mulligan":"Keep three lands, both colors, an early mana rock, and card draw.","tip":"Zaffai triggers for copies as well as casts. A spell with mana value five makes an Elemental; mana value ten also deals ten damage to a random opponent.","keys":["Metallurgic Summonings","Pyromancer's Goggles","Apex of Power"]},
