    "Silverquill Statement": {"route":"politics","pace":"POLITICAL MIDRANGE","complexity":"Intermediate","theme":"Breena rewards carefully chosen attacks with cards and counters while protective threats discourage retaliation.","plan":"Develop mana and let Breena reward attacks at players with more life. Grow evasive threats, redirect pressure through incentives, and keep protection for the closing turns.","mulligan":"Keep both colors, three lands, an early creature or mana rock, and an answer.","tip":"Breena’s trigger compares the attacked player’s life with another of your opponents. Plan attacks and counter placements before committing your strongest creature.","keys":["Felisa, Fang of Silverquill","Nils, Discipline Enforcer","Inkshield"]},
